{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之", "occurrences": 6, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "告", "id": "吿"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "娶", "id": "娶"}, {"form": "少", "id": "少"}, {"form": "年", "id": "年"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "昔", "id": "昔"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "畎畝", "id": "畎畝"}, {"form": "相", "id": "相"}, {"form": "義", "variants": [], "id": "義"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "薦", "id": "薦"}, {"form": "處", "id": "處"}, {"form": "誅", "id": "誅"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.39002408106403, "source": "吿", "target": "娶"}, {"weight": 0.44558510189758965, "source": "吿", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.5982646118359751, "source": "吿", "target": "命"}, {"weight": 1.5982646118359751, "source": "吿", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 1.2565153181139184, "source": "薦", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.8785665769901334, "source": "薦", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 3.1023420086122493, "source": "薦", "target": "昔"}, {"weight": 2.186051276738094, "source": "薦", "target": "年"}, {"weight": 0.556810737007814, "source": "天", "target": "命"}, {"weight": 2.348570206235869, "source": "天", "target": "昔"}, {"weight": 1.432279474361714, "source": "天", "target": "年"}, {"weight": 1.6554230256759237, "source": "天", "target": "誅"}, {"weight": 2.8791984572980396, "source": "年", "target": "昔"}, {"weight": 2.65605490598383, "source": "年", "target": "相"}, {"weight": 2.473733349189875, "source": "年", "target": "少"}, {"weight": 1.9629077254238845, "source": "年", "target": "仁"}